    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338860/extras/f09e130e4721020ac9868cbcc6b1c5d9.poster.avif?t=1755614224\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338860/extras/f09e130e4721020ac9868cbcc6b1c5d9.webm?t=1755614224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338860/extras/f09e130e4721020ac9868cbcc6b1c5d9.mp4?t=1755614224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Alone on the universe\u2019s darkest planet, your only companion is an\u00a0 8-bit computer.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>With its  8-bit interface as your lifeline, you must challenge the planet\u2019s uninhabitable dark surface. Descend into its hostile underworld. Study its alien flora and gather cryptic scientific data\u2014but stay vigilant.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338860/extras/ab16b84ecd63100e17ad988584cb1439.poster.avif?t=1755614224\" width=700 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338860/extras/ab16b84ecd63100e17ad988584cb1439.webm?t=1755614224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338860/extras/ab16b84ecd63100e17ad988584cb1439.mp4?t=1755614224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Yet as you delve deeper, the planet\u2019s physical laws twist. Time fractures, memories distort, and the boundaries of your identity dissolve. Survive the suffocating darkness\u2014but remember: the greatest threat may not lie in the void around you\u2026 but within your own unraveling mind.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>As you engage with classic 2D game mechanics, you\u2019ll begin to recognize patterns that apply to the real world.</strong><br>   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338860/extras/4c1386349a7ab732790b7950ea93b7fd.poster.avif?t=1755614224\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338860/extras/4c1386349a7ab732790b7950ea93b7fd.webp?t=1755614224\" class=\"bb_img\" width=300 height=282 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338860/extras/d09a3539c0d24cde9fb93894d724058f.poster.avif?t=1755614224\" width=300 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338860/extras/d09a3539c0d24cde9fb93894d724058f.webm?t=1755614224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338860/extras/d09a3539c0d24cde9fb93894d724058f.mp4?t=1755614224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Due to the computers 8-bit graphical and communication limitations, you must interpret 2D pixelated visuals and translate them into real-time solutions to overcome various challenges.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your spaceship, now a small base, is your only safe place.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338860/extras/adf9338fdec22fc8e66d4633feea1e0b.avif?t=1755614224\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Here, you can rest, store items, and get new missions.  </i><br><i>But something feels wrong. You were supposed to be alone.  </i><br><i>So why does it feel like someone \u2014 or something \u2014 is watching you?</i><br><br><i></i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338860/extras/6fe8379944cff82bc4f2d2e5b7cb9d4f.avif?t=1755614224\" width=600 height=200 /></span><i> </i><br> <br> <br><i>You hear footsteps in the empty corridors. See shadows that don\u2019t belong to you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Maybe you\u2019re not alone. Or maybe you never were.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third person survival horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive visual storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unique weapons and equipment\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >optimized for low spec computers and handheld devices<br><br><br><br> <br><br> </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338860/extras/f09e130e4721020ac9868cbcc6b1c5d9.poster.avif?t=1755614224\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338860/extras/f09e130e4721020ac9868cbcc6b1c5d9.webm?t=1755614224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338860/extras/f09e130e4721020ac9868cbcc6b1c5d9.mp4?t=1755614224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Alone on the universe\u2019s darkest planet, your only companion is an\u00a0 8-bit computer.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>With its  8-bit interface as your lifeline, you must challenge the planet\u2019s uninhabitable dark surface. Descend into its hostile underworld. Study its alien flora and gather cryptic scientific data\u2014but stay vigilant.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338860/extras/ab16b84ecd63100e17ad988584cb1439.poster.avif?t=1755614224\" width=700 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338860/extras/ab16b84ecd63100e17ad988584cb1439.webm?t=1755614224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338860/extras/ab16b84ecd63100e17ad988584cb1439.mp4?t=1755614224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Yet as you delve deeper, the planet\u2019s physical laws twist. Time fractures, memories distort, and the boundaries of your identity dissolve. Survive the suffocating darkness\u2014but remember: the greatest threat may not lie in the void around you\u2026 but within your own unraveling mind.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>As you engage with classic 2D game mechanics, you\u2019ll begin to recognize patterns that apply to the real world.</strong><br>   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338860/extras/4c1386349a7ab732790b7950ea93b7fd.poster.avif?t=1755614224\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338860/extras/4c1386349a7ab732790b7950ea93b7fd.webp?t=1755614224\" class=\"bb_img\" width=300 height=282 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338860/extras/d09a3539c0d24cde9fb93894d724058f.poster.avif?t=1755614224\" width=300 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338860/extras/d09a3539c0d24cde9fb93894d724058f.webm?t=1755614224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338860/extras/d09a3539c0d24cde9fb93894d724058f.mp4?t=1755614224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Due to the computers 8-bit graphical and communication limitations, you must interpret 2D pixelated visuals and translate them into real-time solutions to overcome various challenges.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your spaceship, now a small base, is your only safe place.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338860/extras/adf9338fdec22fc8e66d4633feea1e0b.avif?t=1755614224\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Here, you can rest, store items, and get new missions.  </i><br><i>But something feels wrong. You were supposed to be alone.  </i><br><i>So why does it feel like someone \u2014 or something \u2014 is watching you?</i><br><br><i></i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338860/extras/6fe8379944cff82bc4f2d2e5b7cb9d4f.avif?t=1755614224\" width=600 height=200 /></span><i> </i><br> <br> <br><i>You hear footsteps in the empty corridors. See shadows that don\u2019t belong to you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Maybe you\u2019re not alone. Or maybe you never were.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third person survival horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive visual storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unique weapons and equipment\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >optimized for low spec computers and handheld devices<br><br><br><br> <br><br> </p></li></ul>",
